    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n87681" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προκατα-λύω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>break up, annul beforehand,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νόμους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					3.84
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν πλοῦν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					56.24
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. τοῦ ἔργου τὸν βίον</span>
			<i>before</i> finishing his work, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Sol.</u>
				32
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ἑαυτόν</span>
			<i>debase</i> oneself <i>too low,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>BJ</u>
				1.6.5
			</span></i>; <i>inhibit, check prematurely,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀναπνοῆς ἐνέργειαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					1.275
				</span></i>
			:—
				Med.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν ἔχθρην π.</span>
			<i>end their mutual</i> enmity <i>before,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				7.6
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν πόλεμον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					22.127.42
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				8.47
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> intr.,
				<i>rest before,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρά τινι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					1.229
				</span></i>
			.</div>
